          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(\\sqrt3-\\sqrt2)^2&=3-2\\sqrt3\\sqrt2+2\\\\(\\sqrt3-\\sqrt2)^2&=5-2\\sqrt6\\end{align*}$$",
